**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/.envrc
**/secrets
**/secrets.*
**/*credentials*.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/.ssh
**/.aws
**/.npmrc
**/.pypirc
**/.netrc
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.cache
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/*.bak
**/*.tmp
